  "prefLabel": "Plc 803.07 Withdrawal of Application for Initial Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 803.07 Withdrawal of Application for Initial Registration.\n\n(a) An applicant may withdraw the application for registration at any time prior to being notified of a decision under Plc 803.08, by proceeding in accordance with Plc 304.07.\n\n(b) If the application is withdrawn, the application processing and licensing fee shall not be refunded.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc800.html"
